5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I think we should start by being thorough. I'll look into the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'll focus on the human element. I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to understand our history better. I'll look into the account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll examine the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll take the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Does anyone else feel we are missing a perspective, or are we satisfied with this distribution of research?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have covered the primary operational and financial bases. I am satisfied with this distribution.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It seems we have a very balanced approach for this round.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree as well. There is no need to overlap our efforts if we trust each other's findings.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,I agree. Let's proceed with these selections and see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
